OL,3,GNEWSASnake Pass slips may top #100m,
OL,4,Acouncil says
OL,5,
OL,6,FActive landslips surrounding Snake Pass
OL,7,Fcould cost more than #100m to
OL,8,Finvestigate and repair, Derbyshire
OL,9,FCounty Council has said.
OL,11,FCharlotte Hill, the authority's cabinet
OL,12,Fmember for highways, said the
OL,13,Fprovisional estimate was "beyond our
OL,14,Fmeans and why we continue to lobby for
OL,15,Fmore funding".
OL,17,FThere are four landslip sites along the
OL,18,FA57 route, which links Sheffield and
OL,19,FManchester at Doctor's Gate, Wood
OL,20,FCottage, Alport and Gillot Hey.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
