OL,4,Acouncil says
OL,5,
OL,6,FHill said a feasibility study for the
OL,7,FDoctors Gate landslip had been recently
OL,8,Fcompleted and there was an agreement to
OL,9,Frepair it using Department for
OL,10,FTransport funding.
